    "Die Vorlage liegt über der Kamera. PinPose sagt dir, was du ändern sollst, und löst aus, sobald die Pose passt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original sits over the camera. PinPose tells you what to change and takes the shot as soon as the pose matches."
          }
        }
      }
    },
